{"lines": [{"text": "Two police officers rang the bell of a museum in Boston, in the middle of the night. Eighty minutes later, half a billion dollars of art was gone.", "start": 0.3, "end": 9.108, "spec": {"shot": "g_hook_door", "ui": "hook500"}, "afx": null, "words": [["Two", 0.096, 0.24], ["police", 0.24, 0.589], ["officers", 0.589, 1.202], ["rang", 1.31, 1.719], ["the", 1.719, 1.815], ["bell", 1.827, 2.151], ["of", 2.163, 2.236], ["a", 2.248, 2.284], ["museum", 2.296, 2.849], ["in", 2.849, 2.933], ["Boston", 2.933, 3.486], ["in", 3.87, 3.918], ["the", 3.918, 3.978], ["middle", 3.978, 4.243], ["of", 4.243, 4.303], ["the", 4.303, 4.351], ["night", 4.351, 4.748], ["Eighty", 5.132, 5.3], ["minutes", 5.301, 5.553], ["later", 5.553, 5.889], ["half", 6.298, 6.55], ["a", 6.635, 6.719], ["billion", 6.827, 7.175], ["dollars", 7.176, 7.524], ["of", 7.524, 7.584], ["art", 7.584, 7.885], ["was", 7.897, 8.065], ["gone", 8.077, 8.449]]}, {"text": "Thirteen works, including a Rembrandt and a Vermeer. And to this day, not a single one has been found.", "start": 9.528, "end": 16.032, "spec": {"shot": "g_hook_frames", "ui": "missing"}, "afx": null, "words": [["Thirteen", 0.168, 0.577], ["works", 0.577, 1.01], ["including", 1.37, 1.743], ["a", 1.743, 1.791], ["Rembrandt", 1.791, 2.38], ["and", 2.488, 2.572], ["a", 2.572, 2.608], ["Vermeer", 2.62, 3.161], ["And", 3.534, 3.582], ["to", 3.582, 3.666], ["this", 3.666, 3.87], ["day", 3.87, 4.219], ["not", 4.495, 4.663], ["a", 4.663, 4.712], ["single", 4.724, 5.204], ["one", 5.216, 5.433], ["has", 5.433, 5.541], ["been", 5.541, 5.685], ["found", 5.685, 6.166]]}, {"text": "That's number one on this list. But first, five other heists so bold they almost look fake.", "start": 16.452, "end": 22.164, "spec": {"shot": "count_wall", "ui": "list"}, "afx": null, "words": [["That's", 0.108, 0.276], ["number", 0.288, 0.517], ["one", 0.529, 0.757], ["on", 0.757, 0.865], ["this", 0.865, 1.046], ["list", 1.046, 1.526], ["But", 1.923, 2.007], ["first", 2.007, 2.44], ["five", 2.452, 2.704], ["other", 2.704, 2.837], ["heists", 2.837, 3.269], ["so", 3.329, 3.846], ["bold", 3.99, 4.363], ["they", 4.375, 4.483], ["almost", 4.483, 4.796], ["look", 4.796, 4.904], ["fake", 4.904, 5.349]]}, {"text": "And watch closely. Because almost every one of these crews made one tiny mistake.", "start": 22.584, "end": 28.104, "spec": {"shot": "magnifier", "ui": "mistake"}, "afx": null, "words": [["And", 0.096, 0.192], ["watch", 0.192, 0.421], ["closely", 0.433, 0.998], ["Because", 1.394, 1.695], ["almost", 1.707, 2.067], ["every", 2.2, 2.452], ["one", 2.452, 2.596], ["of", 2.596, 2.632], ["these", 2.632, 2.776], ["crews", 2.776, 3.209], ["made", 3.221, 3.558], ["one", 3.63, 4.062], ["tiny", 4.074, 4.519], ["mistake", 4.519, 5.168]]}, {"text": "Number six. England, August 8th, 1963. Just after three in the morning, a Royal Mail train is rolling through the dark.", "start": 28.524, "end": 37.884, "spec": {"shot": "t_train_night", "cut": true, "mood": "tense", "ui": "n6"}, "afx": null, "words": [["Number", 0.096, 0.276], ["six", 0.276, 0.817], ["England", 1.19, 1.562], ["August 8th, 1963", 1.935, 4.363], ["Just", 4.76, 4.928], ["after", 4.94, 5.144], ["three", 5.144, 5.529], ["in", 5.589, 5.661], ["the", 5.661, 5.697], ["morning", 5.697, 6.118], ["a", 6.502, 6.538], ["Royal", 6.538, 6.887], ["Mail", 6.887, 7.115], ["train", 7.115, 7.548], ["is", 7.656, 7.8], ["rolling", 7.801, 8.341], ["through", 8.353, 8.522], ["the", 8.534, 8.618], ["dark", 8.618, 9.014]]}, {"text": "It's carrying sacks of used banknotes. Millions of them.", "start": 38.304, "end": 41.856, "spec": {"shot": "t_sacks", "ui": "sacks"}, "afx": null, "words": [["It's", 0.096, 0.18], ["carrying", 0.192, 0.613], ["sacks", 0.625, 1.118], ["of", 1.118, 1.19], ["used", 1.19, 1.514], ["banknotes", 1.526, 2.2], ["Millions", 2.56, 2.909], ["of", 2.921, 2.981], ["them", 2.981, 3.197]]}, {"text": "Up ahead, a signal turns red. So the driver stops the train.", "start": 42.276, "end": 46.284, "spec": {"shot": "t_signal", "ui": "red"}, "afx": null, "words": [["Up", 0.096, 0.204], ["ahead", 0.204, 0.601], ["a", 0.889, 0.925], ["signal", 0.938, 1.334], ["turns", 1.334, 1.611], ["red", 1.623, 1.935], ["So", 2.332, 2.44], ["the", 2.44, 2.5], ["driver", 2.5, 2.873], ["stops", 2.885, 3.221], ["the", 3.221, 3.281], ["train", 3.281, 3.654]]}, {"text": "But the signal was a trick. The gang had covered the green light with a glove, and powered the red light with a battery.", "start": 46.704, "end": 53.088, "spec": {"shot": "t_glove", "ui": "glove"}, "afx": null, "words": [["But", 0.096, 0.168], ["the", 0.168, 0.24], ["signal", 0.252, 0.601], ["was", 0.613, 0.733], ["a", 0.733, 0.769], ["trick", 0.781, 1.226], ["The", 1.635, 1.707], ["gang", 1.707, 1.983], ["had", 1.983, 2.139], ["covered", 2.139, 2.404], ["the", 2.404, 2.464], ["green", 2.464, 2.812], ["light", 2.812, 3.125], ["with", 3.137, 3.281], ["a", 3.281, 3.317], ["glove", 3.317, 3.858], ["and", 4.255, 4.363], ["powered", 4.363, 4.748], ["the", 4.748, 4.82], ["red", 4.832, 5.096], ["light", 5.096, 5.373], ["with", 5.385, 5.529], ["a", 5.529, 5.565], ["battery", 5.577, 6.034]]}, {"text": "Fifteen men stormed the train. The driver, Jack Mills, was hit over the head.", "start": 53.508, "end": 59.124, "spec": {"shot": "t_storm", "ui": "fifteen"}, "afx": null, "words": [["Fifteen", 0.156, 0.565], ["men", 0.577, 0.949], ["stormed", 1.166, 1.538], ["the", 1.538, 1.574], ["train", 1.575, 1.983], ["The", 2.356, 2.404], ["driver", 2.404, 2.921], ["Jack", 3.161, 3.486], ["Mills", 3.486, 4.002], ["was", 4.171, 4.327], ["hit", 4.339, 4.615], ["over", 4.699, 4.856], ["the", 4.856, 4.904], ["head", 4.916, 5.264]]}, {"text": "They unloaded more than two-and-a-half million pounds. Today, that's close to fifty million.", "start": 59.544, "end": 65.088, "spec": {"shot": "t_unload", "ui": "gbp26"}, "afx": null, "words": [["They", 0.096, 0.204], ["unloaded", 0.204, 0.637], ["more", 0.637, 0.974], ["than", 0.986, 1.13], ["two-and-a-half", 1.13, 1.815], ["million", 1.827, 2.212], ["pounds", 2.212, 2.8], ["Today", 3.185, 3.51], ["that's", 3.762, 3.918], ["close", 3.93, 4.243], ["to", 4.243, 4.339], ["fifty", 4.351, 4.796], ["million", 4.796, 5.204]]}, {"text": "Then they hid at a farmhouse. And while they waited, they played Monopoly. With the real money.", "start": 65.508, "end": 71.292, "spec": {"shot": "t_monopoly", "ui": "monopoly"}, "afx": null, "words": [["Then", 0.096, 0.156], ["they", 0.168, 0.252], ["hid", 0.264, 0.589], ["at", 0.601, 0.673], ["a", 0.673, 0.697], ["farmhouse", 0.697, 1.538], ["And", 1.911, 2.019], ["while", 2.031, 2.224], ["they", 2.224, 2.344], ["waited", 2.356, 2.8], ["they", 3.041, 3.173], ["played", 3.173, 3.498], ["Monopoly", 3.51, 4.231], ["With", 4.615, 4.712], ["the", 4.724, 4.808], ["real", 4.808, 5.084], ["money", 5.084, 5.433]]}, {"text": "That was the mistake. Police found the farm, and fingerprints all over the game.", "start": 71.712, "end": 76.44, "spec": {"shot": "t_prints", "ui": "prints"}, "afx": null, "words": [["That", 0.096, 0.204], ["was", 0.216, 0.324], ["the", 0.325, 0.385], ["mistake", 0.385, 0.901], ["Police", 1.286, 1.611], ["found", 1.623, 1.839], ["the", 1.851, 1.899], ["farm", 1.899, 2.332], ["and", 2.596, 2.752], ["fingerprints", 2.933, 3.558], ["all", 3.618, 3.846], ["over", 3.846, 3.954], ["the", 3.966, 4.038], ["game", 4.038, 4.375]]}, {"text": "The leaders got thirty years in prison. One of them, Ronnie Biggs, escaped over the wall on a rope ladder, and stayed on the run for about thirty-six years.", "start": 76.86, "end": 85.788, "spec": {"shot": "t_biggs", "ui": "yrs30"}, "afx": null, "words": [["The", 0.108, 0.18], ["leaders", 0.18, 0.505], ["got", 0.505, 0.709], ["thirty", 0.721, 1.13], ["years", 1.13, 1.49], ["in", 1.49, 1.562], ["prison", 1.575, 1.971], ["One", 2.368, 2.5], ["of", 2.5, 2.584], ["them", 2.584, 2.873], ["Ronnie", 3.137, 3.425], ["Biggs", 3.425, 3.906], ["escaped", 3.942, 4.423], ["over", 4.531, 4.736], ["the", 4.736, 4.808], ["wall", 4.82, 5.204], ["on", 5.204, 5.324], ["a", 5.324, 5.361], ["rope", 5.361, 5.673], ["ladder", 5.685, 6.058], ["and", 6.418, 6.478], ["stayed", 6.478, 6.755], ["on", 6.755, 6.827], ["the", 6.839, 6.899], ["run", 6.899, 7.175], ["for", 7.188, 7.32], ["about", 7.332, 7.548], ["thirty-six", 7.548, 8.113], ["years", 8.113, 8.582]]}, {"text": "And most of the money was never found.", "start": 86.208, "end": 88.176, "spec": {"shot": "t_empty", "ui": "notfound"}, "afx": null, "words": [["And", 0.084, 0.168], ["most", 0.168, 0.421], ["of", 0.433, 0.469], ["the", 0.469, 0.517], ["money", 0.529, 0.793], ["was", 0.805, 0.937], ["never", 0.938, 1.154], ["found", 1.154, 1.623]]}, {"text": "Number five. Paris, August 21st, 1911. It's a Monday, and the Louvre is closed.", "start": 88.596, "end": 95.364, "spec": {"shot": "m_louvre", "cut": true, "mood": "calm", "ui": "n5"}, "afx": null, "words": [["Number", 0.096, 0.276], ["five", 0.276, 0.709], ["Paris", 1.094, 1.623], ["August 21st, 1911", 1.839, 4.002], ["It's", 4.387, 4.483], ["a", 4.483, 4.519], ["Monday", 4.519, 5.072], ["and", 5.264, 5.349], ["the", 5.349, 5.433], ["Louvre", 5.445, 5.745], ["is", 5.757, 5.841], ["closed", 5.841, 6.43]]}, {"text": "A man in a white worker's smock walks in through the staff entrance. Nobody looks twice. He used to work here.", "start": 95.784, "end": 102.48, "spec": {"shot": "m_smock", "ui": "smock"}, "afx": null, "words": [["A", 0.06, 0.108], ["man", 0.108, 0.373], ["in", 0.373, 0.445], ["a", 0.457, 0.517], ["white", 0.517, 0.865], ["worker's", 0.877, 1.358], ["smock", 1.502, 1.887], ["walks", 1.887, 2.26], ["in", 2.272, 2.572], ["through", 2.584, 2.728], ["the", 2.728, 2.788], ["staff", 2.8, 3.161], ["entrance", 3.173, 3.678], ["Nobody", 4.062, 4.303], ["looks", 4.315, 4.483], ["twice", 4.483, 5.252], ["He", 5.649, 5.685], ["used", 5.685, 5.805], ["to", 5.817, 5.853], ["work", 5.865, 6.07], ["here", 6.07, 6.358]]}, {"text": "His name is Vincenzo Peruggia. He walks up to the Mona Lisa, lifts it off the wall, and takes it out of its frame.", "start": 102.9, "end": 110.244, "spec": {"shot": "m_lift", "ui": "lift"}, "afx": null, "words": [["His", 0.096, 0.204], ["name", 0.204, 0.493], ["is", 0.901, 1.01], ["Vincenzo", 1.01, 1.659], ["Peruggia", 1.659, 2.248], ["He", 2.632, 2.668], ["walks", 2.668, 2.933], ["up", 2.933, 3.005], ["to", 3.017, 3.077], ["the", 3.089, 3.149], ["Mona", 3.161, 3.413], ["Lisa", 3.425, 3.93], ["lifts", 4.471, 4.76], ["it", 4.772, 4.832], ["off", 4.832, 5.096], ["the", 5.096, 5.18], ["wall", 5.18, 5.529], ["and", 5.998, 6.07], ["takes", 6.07, 6.298], ["it", 6.298, 6.358], ["out", 6.37, 6.478], ["of", 6.478, 6.526], ["its", 6.526, 6.611], ["frame", 6.611, 7.007]]}, {"text": "At a locked door, a plumber even lets him out, thinking he's staff.", "start": 110.664, "end": 115.08, "spec": {"shot": "m_plumber", "ui": "plumber"}, "afx": null, "words": [["At", 0.096, 0.144], ["a", 0.144, 0.18], ["locked", 0.18, 0.565], ["door", 0.565, 0.901], ["a", 1.286, 1.334], ["plumber", 1.334, 1.731], ["even", 1.743, 1.983], ["lets", 1.983, 2.139], ["him", 2.139, 2.224], ["out", 2.236, 2.536], ["thinking", 2.921, 3.269], ["he's", 3.269, 3.474], ["staff", 3.486, 4.05]]}, {"text": "Nobody notices the painting is gone until the next day.", "start": 115.5, "end": 118.98, "spec": {"shot": "m_empty_wall", "ui": "nextday"}, "afx": null, "words": [["Nobody", 0.084, 0.421], ["notices", 0.433, 0.913], ["the", 0.913, 1.01], ["painting", 1.022, 1.611], ["is", 1.611, 1.731], ["gone", 1.731, 2.151], ["until", 2.26, 2.452], ["the", 2.452, 2.512], ["next", 2.524, 2.776], ["day", 2.788, 3.125]]}, {"text": "Police even question Pablo Picasso. And crowds come to the Louvre just to stare at the empty space on the wall.", "start": 119.4, "end": 125.592, "spec": {"shot": "m_crowd", "ui": "crowd"}, "afx": null, "words": [["Police", 0.096, 0.421], ["even", 0.481, 0.685], ["question", 0.685, 1.154], ["Pablo", 1.166, 1.55], ["Picasso", 1.55, 2.224], ["And", 2.62, 2.692], ["crowds", 2.692, 3.005], ["come", 3.005, 3.173], ["to", 3.173, 3.233], ["the", 3.233, 3.305], ["Louvre", 3.317, 3.798], ["just", 3.966, 4.111], ["to", 4.123, 4.183], ["stare", 4.195, 4.579], ["at", 4.579, 4.639], ["the", 4.639, 4.712], ["empty", 4.724, 5.0], ["space", 5.0, 5.397], ["on", 5.397, 5.493], ["the", 5.493, 5.553], ["wall", 5.565, 5.853]]}, {"text": "For two years, the Mona Lisa sits in a trunk in Peruggia's apartment.", "start": 126.012, "end": 130.692, "spec": {"shot": "m_trunk", "ui": "yrs2"}, "afx": null, "words": [["For", 0.132, 0.228], ["two", 0.24, 0.433], ["years", 0.433, 0.998], ["the", 1.238, 1.31], ["Mona", 1.31, 1.587], ["Lisa", 1.599, 1.995], ["sits", 2.007, 2.344], ["in", 2.344, 2.44], ["a", 2.44, 2.476], ["trunk", 2.488, 2.933], ["in", 3.197, 3.293], ["Peruggia's", 3.305, 3.822], ["apartment", 3.822, 4.351]]}, {"text": "Then he takes it to Florence and offers it to an art dealer. The dealer calls in the museum director, and police arrest Peruggia at his hotel.", "start": 131.112, "end": 139.56, "spec": {"shot": "m_florence", "ui": "arrest"}, "afx": null, "words": [["Then", 0.096, 0.168], ["he", 0.18, 0.276], ["takes", 0.276, 0.529], ["it", 0.529, 0.577], ["to", 0.577, 0.637], ["Florence", 0.637, 1.274], ["and", 1.454, 1.695], ["offers", 1.707, 2.115], ["it", 2.115, 2.199], ["to", 2.2, 2.332], ["an", 2.332, 2.416], ["art", 2.428, 2.656], ["dealer", 2.668, 3.125], ["The", 3.51, 3.618], ["dealer", 3.63, 3.93], ["calls", 3.942, 4.279], ["in", 4.279, 4.327], ["the", 4.339, 4.375], ["museum", 4.375, 4.88], ["director", 4.892, 5.457], ["and", 5.913, 5.962], ["police", 5.962, 6.382], ["arrest", 6.394, 6.731], ["Peruggia", 6.743, 7.284], ["at", 7.404, 7.488], ["his", 7.488, 7.584], ["hotel", 7.584, 8.101]]}, {"text": "He served only about seven months. And many say the theft is what made the Mona Lisa the most famous painting in the world.", "start": 139.98, "end": 147.66, "spec": {"shot": "m_famous", "ui": "famous"}, "afx": null, "words": [["He", 0.096, 0.156], ["served", 0.156, 0.421], ["only", 0.517, 0.769], ["about", 0.769, 0.998], ["seven", 0.998, 1.334], ["months", 1.346, 1.875], ["And", 2.248, 2.32], ["many", 2.332, 2.548], ["say", 2.56, 2.764], ["the", 2.764, 2.861], ["theft", 2.861, 3.413], ["is", 3.75, 3.87], ["what", 3.87, 4.05], ["made", 4.051, 4.375], ["the", 4.387, 4.459], ["Mona", 4.471, 4.772], ["Lisa", 4.772, 5.337], ["the", 5.577, 5.661], ["most", 5.661, 5.937], ["famous", 5.938, 6.346], ["painting", 6.358, 6.791], ["in", 6.791, 6.839], ["the", 6.839, 6.911], ["world", 6.911, 7.332]]}, {"text": "And the Louvre? In 2025, thieves robbed it again. With a ladder truck, in about seven minutes.", "start": 148.08, "end": 154.632, "spec": {"shot": "m_louvre2025", "ui": "l2025"}, "afx": null, "words": [["And", 0.084, 0.144], ["the", 0.144, 0.228], ["Louvre", 0.24, 0.685], ["In 2025", 1.058, 2.139], ["thieves", 2.38, 2.8], ["robbed", 2.8, 3.137], ["it", 3.149, 3.197], ["again", 3.209, 3.582], ["With", 3.978, 4.075], ["a", 4.074, 4.111], ["ladder", 4.111, 4.471], ["truck", 4.471, 4.832], ["in", 5.072, 5.144], ["about", 5.144, 5.361], ["seven", 5.373, 5.709], ["minutes", 5.709, 6.214]]}, {"text": "Number four. London, Easter weekend, 2015.", "start": 155.052, "end": 159.276, "spec": {"shot": "h_street", "cut": true, "mood": "tense", "ui": "n4"}, "afx": null, "words": [["Number", 0.096, 0.288], ["four", 0.3, 0.685], ["London", 1.07, 1.538], ["Easter", 1.803, 2.091], ["weekend", 2.091, 2.56], ["2015", 2.812, 3.858]]}, {"text": "Hatton Garden is London's jewelry district. And under one building sits a vault full of safe deposit boxes.", "start": 159.696, "end": 166.68, "spec": {"shot": "h_vault", "ui": "vault"}, "afx": null, "words": [["Hatton", 0.096, 0.288], ["Garden", 0.288, 0.685], ["is", 0.697, 0.841], ["London's", 0.841, 1.406], ["jewelry", 1.478, 1.875], ["district", 1.887, 2.488], ["And", 2.873, 2.993], ["under", 3.005, 3.221], ["one", 3.221, 3.462], ["building", 3.462, 3.918], ["sits", 4.099, 4.291], ["a", 4.291, 4.339], ["vault", 4.339, 4.784], ["full", 4.796, 5.168], ["of", 5.168, 5.24], ["safe", 5.24, 5.601], ["deposit", 5.601, 6.022], ["boxes", 6.022, 6.623]]}, {"text": "The thieves climb down an elevator shaft. Then they use an industrial drill to bore through a vault wall half a meter thick.", "start": 167.1, "end": 174.972, "spec": {"shot": "h_drill", "ui": "wall50"}, "afx": null, "words": [["The", 0.096, 0.156], ["thieves", 0.156, 0.421], ["climb", 0.421, 0.721], ["down", 0.721, 1.094], ["an", 1.106, 1.25], ["elevator", 1.262, 1.671], ["shaft", 1.671, 2.151], ["Then", 2.548, 2.656], ["they", 2.668, 2.752], ["use", 2.752, 2.981], ["an", 2.981, 3.041], ["industrial", 3.053, 3.618], ["drill", 3.618, 4.038], ["to", 4.183, 4.291], ["bore", 4.303, 4.76], ["through", 4.88, 5.072], ["a", 5.072, 5.12], ["vault", 5.12, 5.517], ["wall", 5.517, 5.95], ["half", 6.166, 6.587], ["a", 6.707, 6.743], ["meter", 6.743, 7.067], ["thick", 7.079, 7.512]]}, {"text": "The alarm goes off. But no police come.", "start": 175.392, "end": 178.152, "spec": {"shot": "h_alarm", "ui": "alarm"}, "afx": null, "words": [["The", 0.084, 0.12], ["alarm", 0.12, 0.445], ["goes", 0.457, 0.721], ["off", 0.721, 1.07], ["But", 1.466, 1.526], ["no", 1.526, 1.683], ["police", 1.683, 2.067], ["come", 2.067, 2.404]]}, {"text": "They walk out with loot worth up to fourteen million pounds.", "start": 178.572, "end": 181.98, "spec": {"shot": "h_loot", "ui": "gbp14"}, "afx": null, "words": [["They", 0.084, 0.168], ["walk", 0.168, 0.421], ["out", 0.421, 0.589], ["with", 0.601, 0.745], ["loot", 0.745, 1.046], ["worth", 1.058, 1.322], ["up", 1.334, 1.478], ["to", 1.49, 1.587], ["fourteen", 1.599, 2.175], ["million", 2.175, 2.452], ["pounds", 2.464, 3.041]]}, {"text": "And the gang? Mostly pensioners. Their ringleader was seventy-six years old.", "start": 182.4, "end": 187.224, "spec": {"shot": "h_grandpas", "ui": "age76"}, "afx": null, "words": [["And", 0.084, 0.144], ["the", 0.144, 0.216], ["gang", 0.228, 0.625], ["Mostly", 1.022, 1.322], ["pensioners", 1.322, 2.031], ["Their", 2.428, 2.632], ["ringleader", 2.632, 3.113], ["was", 3.125, 3.257], ["seventy-six", 3.269, 3.954], ["years", 3.954, 4.183], ["old", 4.183, 4.471]]}, {"text": "Their mistake: they used their own cars. Cameras picked them up, and the police tracked them for weeks.", "start": 187.644, "end": 193.668, "spec": {"shot": "h_cars", "ui": "cars"}, "afx": null, "words": [["Their", 0.096, 0.228], ["mistake", 0.228, 0.685], ["they", 1.082, 1.154], ["used", 1.154, 1.322], ["their", 1.322, 1.454], ["own", 1.466, 1.647], ["cars", 1.647, 2.212], ["Cameras", 2.608, 2.957], ["picked", 2.957, 3.185], ["them", 3.185, 3.305], ["up", 3.317, 3.534], ["and", 3.978, 4.051], ["the", 4.062, 4.147], ["police", 4.147, 4.519], ["tracked", 4.531, 4.904], ["them", 4.904, 5.024], ["for", 5.024, 5.168], ["weeks", 5.18, 5.661]]}, {"text": "Most of them got six to seven years. And millions of pounds' worth of the loot is still missing.", "start": 194.088, "end": 199.872, "spec": {"shot": "h_prison", "ui": "missing4"}, "afx": null, "words": [["Most", 0.072, 0.288], ["of", 0.288, 0.324], ["them", 0.325, 0.433], ["got", 0.445, 0.613], ["six", 0.625, 1.142], ["to", 1.142, 1.238], ["seven", 1.238, 1.587], ["years", 1.599, 2.091], ["And", 2.476, 2.596], ["millions", 2.608, 3.053], ["of", 3.053, 3.137], ["pounds'", 3.137, 3.486], ["worth", 3.486, 3.726], ["of", 3.738, 3.786], ["the", 3.798, 3.858], ["loot", 3.858, 4.243], ["is", 4.615, 4.7], ["still", 4.699, 4.988], ["missing", 5.0, 5.421]]}, {"text": "Number three. Dresden, Germany, November 25th, 2019. Around four in the morning.", "start": 200.292, "end": 207.012, "spec": {"shot": "d_city", "cut": true, "ui": "n3"}, "afx": null, "words": [["Number", 0.072, 0.264], ["three", 0.264, 0.685], ["Dresden", 1.022, 1.683], ["Germany", 1.887, 2.392], ["November 25th, 2019", 2.585, 5.037], ["Around", 5.433, 5.697], ["four", 5.709, 5.901], ["in", 5.901, 5.949], ["the", 5.949, 5.986], ["morning", 5.998, 6.358]]}, {"text": "A fire breaks out in a power box on a bridge. The streetlights go dark.", "start": 207.432, "end": 212.088, "spec": {"shot": "d_fire", "ui": "dark"}, "afx": null, "words": [["A", 0.084, 0.132], ["fire", 0.132, 0.457], ["breaks", 0.457, 0.877], ["out", 0.877, 1.13], ["in", 1.142, 1.214], ["a", 1.214, 1.262], ["power", 1.274, 1.659], ["box", 1.659, 1.959], ["on", 1.971, 2.079], ["a", 2.079, 2.115], ["bridge", 2.127, 2.62], ["The", 2.993, 3.053], ["streetlights", 3.053, 3.726], ["go", 3.726, 3.882], ["dark", 3.894, 4.315]]}, {"text": "Two men cut through the iron bars of a window and climb into the Green Vault, a royal treasure chamber from the 1700s.", "start": 212.508, "end": 220.236, "spec": {"shot": "d_window", "ui": "window"}, "afx": null, "words": [["Two", 0.096, 0.264], ["men", 0.264, 0.541], ["cut", 0.553, 0.841], ["through", 0.853, 1.082], ["the", 1.082, 1.19], ["iron", 1.274, 1.587], ["bars", 1.587, 1.899], ["of", 1.911, 1.947], ["a", 1.947, 2.007], ["window", 2.019, 2.572], ["and", 2.8, 2.945], ["climb", 2.957, 3.486], ["into", 3.594, 3.738], ["the", 3.738, 3.822], ["Green", 3.822, 4.207], ["Vault", 4.207, 4.519], ["a", 4.94, 5.0], ["royal", 5.0, 5.397], ["treasure", 5.397, 5.781], ["chamber", 5.793, 6.118], ["from", 6.13, 6.25], ["the", 6.25, 6.298], ["1700s", 6.298, 7.38]]}, {"text": "They smash a display case with an axe.", "start": 220.656, "end": 223.008, "spec": {"shot": "d_axe", "ui": "axe"}, "afx": null, "words": [["They", 0.108, 0.192], ["smash", 0.204, 0.553], ["a", 0.553, 0.601], ["display", 0.613, 1.01], ["case", 1.01, 1.298], ["with", 1.298, 1.406], ["an", 1.406, 1.466], ["axe", 1.466, 1.995]]}, {"text": "And grab jewelry set with more than four thousand diamonds. Worth more than one hundred and thirteen million euros.", "start": 223.428, "end": 230.028, "spec": {"shot": "d_jewels", "ui": "eur113"}, "afx": null, "words": [["And", 0.096, 0.204], ["grab", 0.216, 0.577], ["jewelry", 0.577, 0.962], ["set", 0.974, 1.346], ["with", 1.358, 1.514], ["more", 1.526, 1.851], ["than", 1.851, 1.983], ["four", 1.995, 2.464], ["thousand", 2.464, 2.921], ["diamonds", 2.921, 3.486], ["Worth", 3.87, 4.014], ["more", 4.014, 4.171], ["than", 4.171, 4.267], ["one", 4.267, 4.375], ["hundred", 4.375, 4.724], ["and", 4.736, 4.856], ["thirteen", 4.868, 5.433], ["million", 5.433, 5.697], ["euros", 5.697, 6.25]]}, {"text": "Their getaway car was later found burned in an underground garage.", "start": 230.448, "end": 234.48, "spec": {"shot": "d_car", "ui": "burned"}, "afx": null, "words": [["Their", 0.096, 0.264], ["getaway", 0.264, 0.577], ["car", 0.577, 0.877], ["was", 0.877, 1.034], ["later", 1.034, 1.43], ["found", 1.43, 1.887], ["burned", 1.899, 2.38], ["in", 2.5, 2.608], ["an", 2.608, 2.704], ["underground", 2.716, 3.113], ["garage", 3.113, 3.666]]}, {"text": "But police tracked down the gang, members of a Berlin crime family.", "start": 234.9, "end": 238.908, "spec": {"shot": "d_police", "ui": "clan"}, "afx": null, "words": [["But", 0.108, 0.192], ["police", 0.204, 0.505], ["tracked", 0.505, 0.841], ["down", 0.841, 1.046], ["the", 1.058, 1.118], ["gang", 1.118, 1.478], ["members", 1.875, 2.163], ["of", 2.163, 2.199], ["a", 2.2, 2.26], ["Berlin", 2.26, 2.764], ["crime", 2.764, 3.125], ["family", 3.137, 3.642]]}, {"text": "In 2022, most of the jewels came back as part of a deal. And in 2023, five men were convicted.", "start": 239.328, "end": 246.648, "spec": {"shot": "d_return", "ui": "back"}, "afx": null, "words": [["In 2022", 0.084, 0.962], ["most", 1.454, 1.659], ["of", 1.659, 1.707], ["the", 1.707, 1.779], ["jewels", 1.779, 2.091], ["came", 2.091, 2.332], ["back", 2.332, 2.788], ["as", 2.921, 3.053], ["part", 3.053, 3.293], ["of", 3.293, 3.341], ["a", 3.341, 3.389], ["deal", 3.401, 3.81], ["And", 4.195, 4.267], ["in 2023", 4.267, 5.349], ["five", 5.721, 6.058], ["men", 6.058, 6.31], ["were", 6.322, 6.43], ["convicted", 6.43, 6.971]]}, {"text": "But some pieces are still missing today.", "start": 247.068, "end": 249.228, "spec": {"shot": "d_missing", "ui": "missing3"}, "afx": null, "words": [["But", 0.096, 0.192], ["some", 0.204, 0.361], ["pieces", 0.373, 0.769], ["are", 0.769, 0.853], ["still", 0.853, 1.046], ["missing", 1.058, 1.37], ["today", 1.37, 1.803]]}, {"text": "Number two. Antwerp, Belgium. The diamond capital of the world. February 2003.", "start": 249.648, "end": 256.416, "spec": {"shot": "a_city", "cut": true, "mood": "tense", "ui": "n2"}, "afx": null, "words": [["Number", 0.084, 0.288], ["two", 0.3, 0.613], ["Antwerp", 1.01, 1.418], ["Belgium", 1.514, 1.971], ["The", 2.368, 2.428], ["diamond", 2.428, 2.776], ["capital", 2.788, 3.209], ["of", 3.209, 3.269], ["the", 3.269, 3.329], ["world", 3.341, 3.726], ["February 2003", 4.195, 6.418]]}, {"text": "A man named Leonardo Notarbartolo rents an office in the Antwerp Diamond Center. For over two years, he plays the part of a diamond trader.", "start": 256.836, "end": 265.596, "spec": {"shot": "a_office", "ui": "yrs2b"}, "afx": null, "words": [["A", 0.072, 0.12], ["man", 0.12, 0.433], ["named", 0.433, 0.709], ["Leonardo", 0.721, 1.238], ["Notarbartolo", 1.25, 2.175], ["rents", 2.464, 2.692], ["an", 2.704, 2.812], ["office", 2.885, 3.426], ["in", 3.57, 3.642], ["the", 3.642, 3.726], ["Antwerp", 3.738, 4.135], ["Diamond", 4.135, 4.447], ["Center", 4.459, 4.844], ["For", 5.288, 5.457], ["over", 5.457, 5.709], ["two", 5.709, 5.962], ["years", 5.962, 6.49], ["he", 6.863, 6.935], ["plays", 6.935, 7.199], ["the", 7.199, 7.296], ["part", 7.308, 7.536], ["of", 7.536, 7.584], ["a", 7.584, 7.644], ["diamond", 7.644, 7.969], ["trader", 7.969, 8.413]]}, {"text": "Below the building sits a vault with a combination lock, heat sensors, a seismic sensor, radar, and a magnetic field.", "start": 266.016, "end": 273.768, "spec": {"shot": "a_vault", "ui": "layers"}, "afx": null, "words": [["Below", 0.096, 0.349], ["the", 0.349, 0.445], ["building", 0.445, 0.781], ["sits", 0.793, 0.998], ["a", 0.998, 1.046], ["vault", 1.046, 1.418], ["with", 1.43, 1.55], ["a", 1.55, 1.599], ["combination", 1.599, 2.236], ["lock", 2.236, 2.62], ["heat", 2.849, 3.053], ["sensors", 3.053, 3.726], ["a", 3.954, 3.99], ["seismic", 4.002, 4.459], ["sensor", 4.471, 4.952], ["radar", 5.397, 5.925], ["and", 6.394, 6.466], ["a", 6.478, 6.502], ["magnetic", 6.502, 6.971], ["field", 6.971, 7.392]]}, {"text": "His crew beat them one by one. Hairspray on the heat sensor. A foam shield in front of the infrared. Tape over the light sensor.", "start": 274.188, "end": 281.988, "spec": {"shot": "a_beat", "ui": "beat"}, "afx": null, "words": [["His", 0.096, 0.204], ["crew", 0.216, 0.565], ["beat", 0.697, 0.95], ["them", 0.95, 1.082], ["one", 1.082, 1.262], ["by", 1.262, 1.43], ["one", 1.43, 1.779], ["Hairspray", 2.188, 2.632], ["on", 2.632, 2.704], ["the", 2.704, 2.74], ["heat", 2.74, 2.957], ["sensor", 2.957, 3.45], ["A", 3.846, 3.918], ["foam", 3.93, 4.255], ["shield", 4.255, 4.687], ["in", 4.699, 4.784], ["front", 4.796, 5.096], ["of", 5.108, 5.156], ["the", 5.156, 5.204], ["infrared", 5.204, 5.769], ["Tape", 6.154, 6.394], ["over", 6.502, 6.647], ["the", 6.659, 6.731], ["light", 6.743, 6.983], ["sensor", 6.983, 7.464]]}, {"text": "Over one weekend, they opened one hundred and nine of one hundred and eighty-nine safe deposit boxes.", "start": 282.408, "end": 288.0, "spec": {"shot": "a_boxes", "ui": "boxes109"}, "afx": null, "words": [["Over", 0.084, 0.325], ["one", 0.337, 0.565], ["weekend", 0.565, 1.082], ["they", 1.37, 1.49], ["opened", 1.538, 1.935], ["one", 2.007, 2.224], ["hundred", 2.236, 2.512], ["and", 2.512, 2.572], ["nine", 2.572, 2.993], ["of", 3.125, 3.209], ["one", 3.209, 3.305], ["hundred", 3.305, 3.534], ["and", 3.534, 3.57], ["eighty-nine", 3.57, 3.942], ["safe", 3.954, 4.219], ["deposit", 4.219, 4.603], ["boxes", 4.615, 5.24]]}, {"text": "The haul was worth more than one hundred million dollars. People called it the heist of the century.", "start": 288.42, "end": 293.748, "spec": {"shot": "a_haul", "ui": "usd100"}, "afx": null, "words": [["The", 0.096, 0.144], ["haul", 0.144, 0.385], ["was", 0.385, 0.517], ["worth", 0.529, 0.733], ["more", 0.745, 1.082], ["than", 1.094, 1.226], ["one", 1.226, 1.358], ["hundred", 1.358, 1.695], ["million", 1.707, 1.983], ["dollars", 1.983, 2.548], ["People", 2.933, 3.245], ["called", 3.245, 3.546], ["it", 3.546, 3.618], ["the", 3.63, 3.702], ["heist", 3.714, 4.243], ["of", 4.243, 4.303], ["the", 4.315, 4.375], ["century", 4.387, 4.988]]}, {"text": "Then, on the way out, they dumped their trash in a forest next to the highway.", "start": 294.168, "end": 298.656, "spec": {"shot": "a_forest", "ui": "trash"}, "afx": null, "words": [["Then", 0.096, 0.361], ["on", 0.553, 0.661], ["the", 0.661, 0.721], ["way", 0.733, 0.937], ["out", 0.95, 1.25], ["they", 1.466, 1.574], ["dumped", 1.587, 1.875], ["their", 1.887, 2.019], ["trash", 2.019, 2.632], ["in", 2.632, 2.716], ["a", 2.716, 2.752], ["forest", 2.752, 3.281], ["next", 3.293, 3.498], ["to", 3.498, 3.546], ["the", 3.546, 3.606], ["highway", 3.606, 4.135]]}, {"text": "The landowner found it the next morning. Inside was a half-eaten salami sandwich.", "start": 299.076, "end": 303.876, "spec": {"shot": "a_sandwich", "ui": "sandwich"}, "afx": null, "words": [["The", 0.096, 0.156], ["landowner", 0.156, 0.673], ["found", 0.685, 0.998], ["it", 1.01, 1.094], ["the", 1.106, 1.178], ["next", 1.178, 1.514], ["morning", 1.514, 1.887], ["Inside", 2.272, 2.596], ["was", 2.608, 2.716], ["a", 2.716, 2.752], ["half-eaten", 2.752, 3.389], ["salami", 3.389, 3.786], ["sandwich", 3.786, 4.435]]}, {"text": "The DNA on it helped convict the gang. Notarbartolo got ten years.", "start": 304.296, "end": 308.856, "spec": {"shot": "a_dna", "ui": "dna10"}, "afx": null, "words": [["The", 0.096, 0.18], ["DNA", 0.18, 0.649], ["on", 0.649, 0.805], ["it", 0.805, 0.853], ["helped", 0.865, 1.094], ["convict", 1.094, 1.538], ["the", 1.538, 1.599], ["gang", 1.611, 2.007], ["Notarbartolo", 2.38, 3.137], ["got", 3.149, 3.365], ["ten", 3.377, 3.654], ["years", 3.666, 4.195]]}, {"text": "But most of the diamonds were never found.", "start": 309.276, "end": 311.364, "spec": {"shot": "a_never", "ui": "never2"}, "afx": null, "words": [["But", 0.108, 0.192], ["most", 0.192, 0.433], ["of", 0.433, 0.481], ["the", 0.481, 0.553], ["diamonds", 0.565, 0.949], ["were", 0.95, 1.034], ["never", 1.034, 1.274], ["found", 1.274, 1.731]]}, {"text": "And number one. Boston, March 18th, 1990. The early hours of the morning.", "start": 311.784, "end": 317.568, "spec": {"shot": "g_street", "cut": true, "mood": "tense", "ui": "n1"}, "afx": null, "words": [["And", 0.096, 0.156], ["number", 0.168, 0.385], ["one", 0.397, 0.697], ["Boston", 1.094, 1.514], ["March 18th, 1990", 1.959, 3.834], ["The", 4.231, 4.291], ["early", 4.291, 4.603], ["hours", 4.603, 4.94], ["of", 4.94, 4.988], ["the", 4.988, 5.024], ["morning", 5.024, 5.421]]}, {"text": "Two men in police uniforms ring the bell at the Isabella Stewart Gardner Museum. They say they're responding to a disturbance.", "start": 317.988, "end": 325.356, "spec": {"shot": "g_bell", "ui": "uniform"}, "afx": null, "words": [["Two", 0.096, 0.228], ["men", 0.228, 0.409], ["in", 0.409, 0.505], ["police", 0.505, 0.925], ["uniforms", 0.938, 1.587], ["ring", 1.659, 1.983], ["the", 1.983, 2.067], ["bell", 2.067, 2.452], ["at", 2.656, 2.74], ["the", 2.74, 2.812], ["Isabella", 2.897, 3.389], ["Stewart", 3.401, 3.906], ["Gardner", 3.906, 4.219], ["Museum", 4.219, 4.712], ["They", 5.108, 5.168], ["say", 5.18, 5.385], ["they're", 5.385, 5.493], ["responding", 5.493, 6.082], ["to", 6.094, 6.214], ["a", 6.214, 6.262], ["disturbance", 6.274, 7.019]]}, {"text": "The guard breaks the rules, and lets them in.", "start": 325.776, "end": 328.44, "spec": {"shot": "g_letin", "ui": "rules"}, "afx": null, "words": [["The", 0.096, 0.156], ["guard", 0.156, 0.445], ["breaks", 0.445, 0.769], ["the", 0.769, 0.841], ["rules", 0.841, 1.454], ["and", 1.695, 1.815], ["lets", 1.815, 1.971], ["them", 1.971, 2.067], ["in", 2.067, 2.32]]}, {"text": "Minutes later, both guards are tied up in the basement.", "start": 328.86, "end": 332.1, "spec": {"shot": "g_basement", "ui": "tied"}, "afx": null, "words": [["Minutes", 0.084, 0.337], ["later", 0.337, 0.721], ["both", 0.974, 1.214], ["guards", 1.214, 1.502], ["are", 1.514, 1.587], ["tied", 1.587, 1.923], ["up", 1.923, 2.139], ["in", 2.224, 2.284], ["the", 2.284, 2.356], ["basement", 2.356, 2.873]]}, {"text": "For about eighty minutes, the thieves walk through the museum.", "start": 332.52, "end": 335.976, "spec": {"shot": "g_walk", "ui": "min80"}, "afx": null, "words": [["For", 0.132, 0.228], ["about", 0.228, 0.481], ["eighty", 0.493, 0.697], ["minutes", 0.709, 1.166], ["the", 1.322, 1.442], ["thieves", 1.442, 1.863], ["walk", 1.863, 2.368], ["through", 2.368, 2.536], ["the", 2.536, 2.584], ["museum", 2.584, 3.101]]}, {"text": "They take thirteen works. Rembrandt's Storm on the Sea of Galilee. Vermeer's The Concert.", "start": 336.396, "end": 341.988, "spec": {"shot": "g_take", "ui": "works13"}, "afx": null, "words": [["They", 0.096, 0.156], ["take", 0.156, 0.361], ["thirteen", 0.361, 0.877], ["works", 0.877, 1.382], ["Rembrandt's", 1.779, 2.212], ["Storm", 2.224, 2.596], ["on", 2.692, 2.752], ["the", 2.752, 2.812], ["Sea", 2.825, 3.257], ["of", 3.257, 3.341], ["Galilee", 3.341, 3.822], ["Vermeer's", 4.219, 4.651], ["The", 4.663, 4.748], ["Concert", 4.748, 5.252]]}, {"text": "Together, worth around five hundred million dollars. The biggest art theft in history.", "start": 342.408, "end": 348.312, "spec": {"shot": "g_value", "ui": "usd500"}, "afx": null, "words": [["Together", 0.096, 0.529], ["worth", 0.974, 1.166], ["around", 1.166, 1.502], ["five", 1.514, 1.875], ["hundred", 1.875, 2.2], ["million", 2.212, 2.572], ["dollars", 2.572, 3.137], ["The", 3.534, 3.606], ["biggest", 3.618, 3.978], ["art", 3.99, 4.231], ["theft", 4.243, 4.724], ["in", 4.88, 4.976], ["history", 4.976, 5.541]]}, {"text": "The museum offers a reward of ten million dollars. It has never been paid.", "start": 348.732, "end": 353.388, "spec": {"shot": "g_reward", "ui": "reward10"}, "afx": null, "words": [["The", 0.096, 0.144], ["museum", 0.144, 0.697], ["offers", 0.841, 1.166], ["a", 1.166, 1.202], ["reward", 1.214, 1.731], ["of", 1.731, 1.815], ["ten", 1.827, 2.151], ["million", 2.151, 2.428], ["dollars", 2.428, 3.005], ["It", 3.389, 3.425], ["has", 3.425, 3.534], ["never", 3.534, 3.75], ["been", 3.762, 3.906], ["paid", 3.906, 4.303]]}, {"text": "The FBI later named two suspects. Both are dead.", "start": 353.808, "end": 357.576, "spec": {"shot": "g_fbi", "ui": "fbi"}, "afx": null, "words": [["The", 0.096, 0.168], ["FBI", 0.168, 0.649], ["later", 0.649, 0.949], ["named", 0.95, 1.262], ["two", 1.346, 1.647], ["suspects", 1.659, 2.5], ["Both", 2.909, 3.077], ["are", 3.077, 3.125], ["dead", 3.125, 3.413]]}, {"text": "And today, the empty frames still hang on the wall. Waiting for the paintings to come home.", "start": 357.996, "end": 363.492, "spec": {"shot": "g_frames_end", "mood": "calm", "ui": "frames"}, "afx": null, "words": [["And", 0.084, 0.144], ["today", 0.144, 0.601], ["the", 1.01, 1.118], ["empty", 1.226, 1.454], ["frames", 1.454, 2.031], ["still", 2.212, 2.452], ["hang", 2.452, 2.728], ["on", 2.728, 2.801], ["the", 2.8, 2.861], ["wall", 2.861, 3.173], ["Waiting", 3.558, 3.81], ["for", 3.81, 3.882], ["the", 3.882, 3.966], ["paintings", 3.966, 4.507], ["to", 4.507, 4.591], ["come", 4.603, 4.808], ["home", 4.808, 5.144]]}, {"text": "So, which heist was the boldest? Tell me in the comments. And subscribe to Roundhead Stories for more true money stories.", "start": 363.912, "end": 371.352, "spec": {"shot": "outro", "mood": "bright", "ui": "end"}, "afx": null, "words": [["So", 0.096, 0.385], ["which", 0.601, 0.721], ["heist", 0.721, 1.058], ["was", 1.058, 1.166], ["the", 1.178, 1.25], ["boldest", 1.25, 1.827], ["Tell", 2.2, 2.32], ["me", 2.332, 2.44], ["in", 2.452, 2.512], ["the", 2.